WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Find a publication route. Start with author costs, research fit and the venue’s conditions.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Choose a field. The default shows free author routes with core editorial standards documented.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Select up to three venues. A shortlist helps compare possibilities; scope still needs checking.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:40.000
View the comparison. Submission cost and publication cost are separate fields.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Read the cost conditions and sources. Optional open access and reader subscriptions are separate.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Read AI disclosure and restrictions. Follow the venue’s official instructions; people remain responsible.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Copy the directory URL to save the filters and selected venues. Reopening it restores the shortlist.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Help with a short source note or a use report. The starter tasks need no coding or installation.
